Overview

This case study documents the investigation of high-volume authentication attempts detected on a monitored workstation. The activity appeared consistent with automated credential stuffing / password spraying targeting local accounts.

The investigation focused on determining whether the authentication attempts resulted in successful compromise, privilege escalation, persistence, or lateral movement.

